#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In order to get the most out of these releases, we recommend to use a "
#| "recent version of Qt, such as 4.8.4. This is necessary in order to assure "
#| "a stable and performant experience, as some improvements made to KDE "
#| "software have actually been done in the underlying Qt framework.<br />\n"
#| "In order to make full use of the capabilities of KDE's software, we also "
