"You can now choose <a href='%[1]s'>which split view pane to close</a> when "
"clicking the 'Close split' button."
msgstr ""
"Agora pode escoller <a href='%1'>que panel dividido pechar</a> ao pechar o "
"botón de «Pechar a división»."

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/19.04.0.md:31
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This version of Dolphin introduces <a href='%1'>smarter tab placement</"
#| "a>. When you open a folder in a new tab, the new tab will now be placed "
#| "immediately to the right of the current one, instead of always at the end "
