#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/19.04.0.md:184
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "We have extended the Rectangular Region mode with a few new options. It "
#| "can be configured to <a href='%1'>auto-accept</a> the dragged box instead "
#| "of asking you to adjust it first. There is also a new default option to "
