#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:42
msgid ""
"Added KPropertiesDialog::KPropertiesDialog(urls) and KPropertiesDialog::"
"showDialog(urls)."
msgstr ""
"Engadíronse KPropertiesDialog::KPropertiesDialog(urls) e KPropertiesDialog::"
"showDialog(urls)."

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:43
msgid ""
"Asynchronous QIODevice-based data fetch for KIO::storedPut and KIO::"
"AccessManager::put."
msgstr ""
"Obtención asíncrona de datos baseada en QIODevice para KIO::storedPut e KIO::"
"AccessManager::put."

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:44
msgid "Fix conditions with QFile::rename return value (bug 343329)"
msgstr ""
"Corrixir as condicións co valor de retorno de QFile::rename (fallo 343329)"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:45
msgid "Fixed KIO::suggestName to suggest better names (bug 341773)"
msgstr "Corrixiuse KIO::suggestName para suxerir nomes mellores (fallo 341773)"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:46
msgid "kioexec: Fixed path for writeable location for kurl (bug 343329)"
msgstr ""
"kioexec: Corrixiuse a ruta do lugar que permite escritura de kurl (fallo "
"343329)"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:47
msgid "Store bookmarks only in user-places.xbel (bug 345174)"
msgstr "Só almacenar os marcadores en user-places.xbel (fallo 345174)"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:48
msgid ""
"Duplicate RecentDocuments entry if two different files have the same name"
msgstr ""
"Entrada duplicada de RecentDocuments se dous ficheiros distintos teñen o "
"mesmo nome"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:49
msgid ""
"Better error message if a single file is too large for the trash (bug 332692)"
msgstr ""
"Mellor mensaxe de erro se un único ficheiro é grande de máis para o lixo "
"(fallo 332692)"

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/frameworks/5/5.10.0.md:50
msgid "Fix KDirLister crash upon redirection when the slot calls openURL"
msgstr ""
"Corrixir a quebra de KDirLister ao redirixir canto a rañura chama a openURL"

