msgid ""
"New module. The Quick Charts module provides a set of charts that can be "
"used from QtQuick applications. They are intended to be used for both simple "
"display of data as well as continuous display of high-volume data (often "
"referred to as plotters). The charts use a system called distance fields for "
"their accelerated rendering, which provides ways of using the GPU for "
"rendering 2D shapes without loss of quality."
