#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.0.md:0
msgid "KDE Plasma 5.17: Thunderbolt, X11 Night Color and Redesigned Settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.0.md:7
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.1.md:7
