#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.0.md:0
msgid ""
"Plasma 5.18 adds an emoji selector, user feedback capabilties, a global edit "
"mode and improves and expands System Settings, the Discover software "
"manager, widgets, GTK integration and much more."
msgstr ""

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.0.md:0
msgid "KDE Plasma 5.18: More Convenient and with Long Term Stability"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.0.md:7
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.1.md:7
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.2.md:7
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.3.md:7
