#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:195
msgid "Gustavo doing what he liked to do best: tinkering with tech."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:197
msgid ""
"Plasma 5.21 is dedicated to Gustavo Carneiro, a KDE contributor from Brazil "
"that left us in January victim of COVID-19."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:199
msgid ""
"KDE was Gustavo's first free software experience, and he embraced it. "
"Although he did not start out as a C++ developer, he worked hard to learn "
"and improve the systems that he was using."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:201
msgid ""
"Among many other things, Gustavo became a major contributor to KDE's "
"terminal emulator, Konsole, and went on to develop technologies some of "
"which are so new, they have not even been released yet."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:203
msgid "Now his legacy lives on within Konsole."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:205
msgid "Gustavo, thank you for your help."
msgstr ""

