#~ "sobre o que ocorre en KDE, involucrarse, ou simplemente coñecer a outros "
#~ "usuarios e colaboradores."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "These release announcements were prepared by the KDE Promotion Team and "
#~ "the wider KDE community. They cover highlights of the many changes made "
