#~ "</ul>\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<h3>KDeclarative</h3>\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<ul>\n"
#~ "<li>Use Qt's method of blocking for component completion rather than our "
#~ "own</li>\n"
